# Local MapMaker seed dir for styleeditor dev runs (DEPLOYMENT=org): the child
# configs + the `maptoolkit.json` parent, mirrored from styles.maptoolkit.org/raw.
# In production these are generated by the k8s-org styles-cronjob and served from
# the styles host — they are not published content of this repo.
# Matches both styles/raw/ and styles/<account>/raw/.
styles/**/raw/
